          <h3>Grow together, not alone.</h3>
          <p>
            Create shared gardens with friends, family, or groups who are keeping goals
            together. Everyone grows their own plants while staying accountable together.
          </p>
        </div>
      </a>

      <div class="zdp-feature-stack">

        <a href="/pages/goal-grower" class="zdp-feature-card zdp-feature-card--small">
          <span>Goal Plants</span>
          <h3>Every goal becomes a plant.</h3>
