          <h3>Miss too long and it starts to die.</h3>
          <p>
            Your plant gives visual feedback when a goal needs attention, making consistency
            feel immediate and clear.
          </p>
        </a>

      </div>

      <a href="/pages/beta" class="zdp-feature-card zdp-feature-card--horizontal">
        <div>
          <span>Beta Testing</span>
          <h3>Help test Goal Grower before launch.</h3>
          <p>
            The app is still being built and needs testers before App Store release.
            Test shared gardens, find bugs, and help shape the experience.
