  <section class="zdp-incubator">
    <div class="zdp-incubator__header">
      <p class="zdp-eyebrow">In Development</p>
      <h2>Built around the Goal Grower ecosystem</h2>
      <p>
        These features and companion ideas support the larger mission: making goals,
        habits, focus, and personal growth feel visible, social, and rewarding.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="zdp-incubator__grid">
      <article class="zdp-incubator-card">
        <span>Core Feature</span>
        <h3>Goal Plants</h3>
        <p>Each goal becomes its own plant. Water it through progress, consistency, and daily action.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="zdp-incubator-card">
        <span>Core Feature</span>
        <h3>Personal Garden</h3>
        <p>Your garden becomes a visual map of the goals and habits you are currently growing.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="zdp-incubator-card">
        <span>Live Feature</span>
        <h3>Shared Gardens</h3>
        <p>Grow goals with friends, family, or groups. Shared gardens help people stay accountable together.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="zdp-incubator-card">
        <span>Gamification</span>
        <h3>Plant Health</h3>
        <p>If you stop watering a goal, the plant starts to die. The goal is visual feedback, not punishment.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="zdp-incubator-card">
        <span>Needed Now</span>
        <h3>Beta Testing</h3>
        <p>Goal Grower needs testers before App Store release to improve quality, bugs, and user experience.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="zdp-incubator-card">
        <span>Future Growth</span>
        <h3>Garden Expansion</h3>
        <p>More plant types, rewards, progress views, streaks, and garden customization are planned.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="zdp-other-projects">
  <div class="zdp-other-projects__copy">
    <p class="zdp-eyebrow">Beyond Goal Grower</p>
    <h2>Other ideas are growing too.</h2>
    <p>
      Goal Grower is the main project right now, but Ziyu Development is also building
      toward a larger ecosystem of tools for focus, reflection, learning, and intentional living.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="zdp-other-projects__list">
    <article>
      <span>Focus</span>
      <h3>Blokkr</h3>
      <p>A distraction-blocking tool for protecting deep work and reducing digital noise.</p>
    </article>

    <article>
      <span>Reflection</span>
      <h3>MyJourney</h3>
      <p>A life archive and planning system for tracking growth, memories, and milestones.</p>
    </article>

    <article>
      <span>Reading</span>
      <h3>KindLitt</h3>
      <p>A calmer reading environment for thoughtful books, notes, and knowledge building.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

  <section class="zdp-cta">
    <p class="zdp-eyebrow">Support Development</p>
    <h2>Help Goal Grower reach beta testers and the App Store.</h2>
    <p>
      Goal Grower is still being built and tested. Your support helps fund development,
      app store testing, design improvements, shared garden features, and the tools
      needed to turn this into a real app people can use.
    </p>
    <div>
      <a href="/pages/support">Support Development</a>
      <a href="/pages/beta">Become a Beta Tester</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="zdp-pitch">
    <p class="zdp-eyebrow">Build With Us</p>
    <h2>Have an idea you want Ziyu Development to create?</h2>
    <p>
      Pitch your app, website, automation, design, or product idea. If it fits our
      mission and is possible to build, it may become a future Ziyu Development project.
    </p>
    <a href="/pages/contact">Pitch Your Idea</a>
  </section>

</main>

